  "description": "Celebrate the magic of the holiday season with Everly Christmas, a charming and elegant Christmas script font designed to bring warmth, joy, and festive beauty to your creative projects.\nFeaturing flowing handwritten letters, graceful decorative swashes, and a touch of timeless elegance, Everly Christmas captures the enchanting spirit of Christmas. Its beautiful curves and ornamental details make every word feel special, creating eye-catching designs filled with holiday charm.\nPerfect for Christmas greeting cards, holiday invitations, gift tags, festive packaging, seasonal branding, posters, apparel, mugs, stickers, and DIY crafts, Everly Christmas adds a beautiful handwritten touch to every creation.\nWhether you’re designing heartfelt holiday greetings, personalized gifts, or enchanting Christmas collections, Everly Christmas is ready to make your festive ideas shine.\nExclusively released by Dani7NTypes on Creative Fabrica.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Celebrate the magic of the holiday season with Everly Christmas, a charming and elegant Christmas script font designed to bring warmth, joy, and festive beauty to your creative projects.</p>\n<p>Featuring flowing handwritten letters, graceful decorative swashes, and a touch of timeless elegance, Everly Christmas captures the enchanting spirit of Christmas. Its beautiful curves and ornamental details make every word feel special, creating eye-catching designs filled with holiday charm.</p>\n<p>Perfect for Christmas greeting cards, holiday invitations, gift tags, festive packaging, seasonal branding, posters, apparel, mugs, stickers, and DIY crafts, Everly Christmas adds a beautiful handwritten touch to every creation.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re designing heartfelt holiday greetings, personalized gifts, or enchanting Christmas collections, Everly Christmas is ready to make your festive ideas shine.</p>\n<p>Exclusively released by Dani7NTypes on Creative Fabrica.</p>",
